---
// Two questions you can ask a ranking model: a global one (what does it lean on across all stocks?)
// and a local one (why did it put THIS stock where it did?). Static, bilingual, tokens only.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 330;
---
<figure class="atp09-tq">
  <div class="atp09-tq-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A ranking model can be asked two kinds of question. The global question asks which features the model leans on across all stocks. The local question asks why it gave one particular stock its score.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Two different questions about the same model</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai câu hỏi khác nhau về cùng một mô hình</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="20" y="46" width="410" height="230" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={50} y={80} size={26} />
      <text x="76" y="86" class="t">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Global: what does it lean on?</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Toàn cục: nó dựa vào đâu?</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="40" y="122" class="b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Looks at every stock at once.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhìn tất cả cổ phiếu cùng lúc.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="40" y="146" class="b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Answer: a list of features, biggest first.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Câu trả lời: danh sách feature, lớn nhất trước.</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="40" y="166" width="370" height="86" rx="6" class="ex" />
      <text x="54" y="190" class="exh">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Real example (Gu, Kelly, Xiu 2020)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ví dụ thật (Gu, Kelly, Xiu 2020)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="54" y="212" class="exb">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Across methods, the dominant signals were</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Qua nhiều phương pháp, các tín hiệu trội đều là</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="54" y="232" class="exb">
        <tspan data-lang-en>momentum, liquidity and volatility.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>momentum, thanh khoản và biến động.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="470" y="46" width="410" height="230" rx="8" class="card is-key" />
      <DiagramIcon name="search" x={500} y={80} size={26} />
      <text x="526" y="86" class="t">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Local: why this stock?</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cục bộ: vì sao cổ phiếu này?</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="122" class="b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Looks at one prediction.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhìn một dự đoán.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="146" class="b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Answer: how each feature moved its score.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Câu trả lời: mỗi feature kéo điểm đi bao nhiêu.</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="490" y="166" width="370" height="86" rx="6" class="ex" />
      <text x="504" y="190" class="exh">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Example in this post</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ví dụ trong bài này</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="504" y="212" class="exb">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Stock D scores 1.54 against an average of</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cổ phiếu D được 1,54 điểm, trung bình là</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="504" y="232" class="exb">
        <tspan data-lang-en>-0.07. Which features made up the gap?</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>-0,07. Những feature nào tạo ra khoảng cách đó?</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="20" y="310" class="n">
        <tspan data-lang-en>This post spends most of its time on the right-hand question, because it is the one a reviewer asks about a single pick.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bài này dành phần lớn thời gian cho câu bên phải, vì đó là câu người duyệt hỏi về từng mã được chọn.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp09-tq { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp09-tq-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp09-tq svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .atp09-tq text { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 14px; }
  .atp09-tq .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp09-tq .t { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp09-tq .b { font-size: 14px; }
  .atp09-tq .n { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp09-tq .exh { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp09-tq .exb { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp09-tq .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp09-tq .card.is-key { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .atp09-tq .ex { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); }
</style>
